{"id":"cabinet:gem+gemr","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"Middle shelf is half-empty on the right (x=10..13), top-left purple cluster reads as two vertical bottles on a flat grey bar, and the red/yellow/green cut gems read as round blobs or bushes rather than faceted gems."}
{"id":"cabinet:bolt+boltg+boltr","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"Top and middle draped fabrics read as flat boxy pouches/cans with horizontal stripes on a barely visible brown rod, while bottom folded stacks read as ribbed vertical barrels instead of cloth bolts."}
{"id":"cabinet:bottle+bottler+bottlel","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"Top-right wide red bottle reads as a boxy toolbox/battery with a white bar, and the narrow bottles have 2px corks, necks, and lit bodies of identical width so they read as striped sticks rather than shouldered bottles."}
{"id":"cabinet:candle","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"Palette snapping collapses the cream wax tones into a flat 3x3 block with no top-plane separation, and the middle-left flame touches the upper shelf plank so it reads as a brown bottle neck/cork rather than fire."}
